    "faq_bundle": {
      "type": "collapsible-content-2",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_whats_included": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHAT'S IN THE 3-MONTH SUPPLY?",
            "open": true,
            "content": "<p>Two tubs of Bodology Myo + D-Chiro Inositol at the 40:1 ratio, shipped together every 3 months. Your first order also includes the <strong>Metabolic Health Protocol</strong> e-guide, free.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_subscription": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW DOES THE SUBSCRIPTION WORK?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>You're billed once every 3 months and both tubs ship together. There's no lock-in — you can <strong>pause, skip, or cancel anytime</strong> from your account, and shipping is free on every subscription delivery.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_how_to_take": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW DO I TAKE IT?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><strong>2 scoops daily</strong> — 4,000mg myo-inositol + 100mg D-chiro-inositol. It's an unflavored powder, so it mixes into water, coffee, or a smoothie.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_switch": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "CAN I SWITCH PLANS LATER?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Yes. You can move between the 3-month and 6-week plans from your account at any time, or contact us and we'll change it for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_tested": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "IS IT TESTED?",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Every batch is third-party tested at ISO/IEC 17025-accredited labs: HPLC confirms the identity, potency, and 40:1 ratio of both inositols, plus heavy metal and microbial safety testing. Made in the USA in a GMP- and FDA-compliant facility. Vegan, gluten-free, non-GMO.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
